    "title": "Miami Dolphins",
    "description": "The official app of the Miami Dolphins and Hard Rock Stadium provides fans with the latest Dolphins news, videos, photos, and team content. Easily switch to the Hard Rock Stadium experience to enhance your event day and see all that is happening at the stadium.\r\n\r\nFeatures include:\r\n\r\nThe latest news, video, photos, and podcasts from \r\n\r\nMiamiDolphins.com\r\n\r\nHard Rock Stadium experience including upcoming events and stadium maps\r\n\r\nSchedule, player roster and coaches\r\n\r\nMiami Dolphins Cheerleader team and photos\r\n\r\nPersonalized Member Central: manage tickets, mobile wallet, and view your favorite content\r\n\r\nLive game day radio (within 75 miles of Hard Rock Stadium)\r\n\r\nNFL Game Center with play-by-play, scoring drives, stats, and game day livestreaming\r\n\r\nPlease note: This app features Nielsen\u2019s proprietary measurement software which contributes to market research, like Nielsen\u2019s TV Ratings. Please see Digital Measurement Privacy Statement  for more information.",
